bottomparticipants

title Subsequence - Vote Reply 1

actor User
boundary "Reply Section (UI)" as UI
boundary Router
control ReplyController
control ReplyService
entity ":VoteReplyModel" as VoteReplyModel
database MongoDB

ReplyService -> VoteReplyModel: 1. findOne(reply_id, user_id)
activate VoteReplyModel
activate ReplyService
VoteReplyModel -> MongoDB: 2. query vote
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> VoteReplyModel: 3. existingVote / null
deactivate MongoDB
VoteReplyModel --> ReplyService: 4. result
deactivate VoteReplyModel

ReplyService -> ReplyService: 5. Check existing vote state
activate ReplyService
space
deactivate ReplyService

alt No existing vote
    ReplyService -> VoteReplyModel: 5.1.1 create new vote (is_up=false)
    activate VoteReplyModel
    VoteReplyModel -> MongoDB: 5.1.2 insert vote
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> VoteReplyModel: 5.1.3 inserted document
    deactivate MongoDB
    VoteReplyModel --> ReplyService: 5.1.4 created vote
    deactivate VoteReplyModel
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 5.1.5 Reply downvoted
    activate ReplyController
    ReplyController --> Router: 5.1.6 Reply downvoted response
    activate Router
    Router --> UI: 5.1.7 Update reply vote state
    activate UI
    UI --> User: 5.1.8 See updated reply downvote
    activate User
else Existing vote is down
    ReplyService -> VoteReplyModel: 5.2.1 delete vote
    activate VoteReplyModel
    VoteReplyModel -> MongoDB: 5.2.2 delete document
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> VoteReplyModel: 5.2.3 deletion confirmation
    deactivate MongoDB
    VoteReplyModel --> ReplyService: 5.2.4 vote deleted
    deactivate VoteReplyModel
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 5.2.5 Reply downvote removed
    ReplyController --> Router: 5.2.6 Reply downvote removed response
    Router --> UI: 5.2.7 Update reply vote state
    UI --> User: 5.2.8 See removed reply downvote
else Existing vote is up
    ReplyService -> VoteReplyModel: 5.3.1 update is_up=false
    activate VoteReplyModel
    VoteReplyModel -> MongoDB: 5.3.2 update document
    activate MongoDB
    MongoDB --> VoteReplyModel: 5.3.3 updated document
    deactivate MongoDB
    VoteReplyModel --> ReplyService: 5.3.4 vote updated
    deactivate VoteReplyModel
    ReplyService --> ReplyController: 5.3.5 Reply downvoted
    deactivate ReplyService
    ReplyController --> Router: 5.3.6 Reply downvoted response
    deactivate ReplyController
    Router --> UI: 5.3.7 Update reply vote state
    deactivate Router
    UI --> User: 5.3.8 See updated reply downvote
    deactivate UI
    deactivate User
end